"about": {"track":"Pärnu, Estonija (id parnu): the circuit at Papsaare by Pärnu, its layout since 2012 (3.2 km, 15 corners, counterclockwise as raced), one lap (docs/dirkalisca-celine.md, »Novih pet«). The route: OSM's highway=raceway ways 248122258 (the main straight past the pits, the north-west hairpin and the run back), 1225017291 (the chicane), 45482078 (the south loop, the east straight, the run through the middle), 45482081 and 248122257 (the twisty north section); not the short cuts 1225017288, 1225017290, 1225017294 and 827038996. The pit lane: the service way w827039000 on the right of the main straight, between the pit wall and the garages (w320391625).","frame":"metres; origin = the start line (lat0, lon0: the first point of the route); x east, z south; x = (lon - lon0) * N cos(lat0), z = -(lat - lat0) * M (WGS84 radii at lat0)","line":"the centre line every 4.997 m from the start line round the lap (closed; the last point joins the first): OSM's polyline every 1 m, a Gaussian of sigma 3 m (the corners rounded), resampled","h":"the road's height at each point of line (m above sea level, 0.1 m): the ground model across the road (median of 5 samples, -8..8 m), the bridges straight from bank to bank, dips under 60 m filled, a 35 m median, sigma 15 m, grades at most 12 %, sigma 5 m","hRaw":"the ground model under each point of line before the smoothing (m, 0.1 m)","ways":"[s0, s1, road name (geographic names only), OSM highway, lanes, width, oneway today, surface, maxspeed, bridge]: the route's OSM ways in driving order (s in m from the start line)","bends":"[s of the apex, radius m, side (1 right, -1 left), turn deg]: the bends of line with a radius under 60 m","bld":"[x, z, length, width, angle (rad, the long side from +x towards +z), height (m, 0 = not in OSM), kind, s, d (m, + right of the travel direction)]: the buildings with any part within 60 m (OSM); kinds: 0 house / unknown, 1 church / chapel, 2 tower, 3 castle, 4 shed / garage / kiosk, 5 commercial / hotel / industrial, 6 public / station / school, 7 greenhouse, 8 ruin, 9 block of flats","bldOutline":"[index in bld, [x, z, ...]]: the outline of the buildings that are not a rectangle","trees":"[x, z, kind]: single trees (OSM) within 60 m; kind p pine, c cypress, o olive, m palm, b broadleaved, '' unknown","treeRows":"[kind, [x, z, ...]]","walls":"[barrier (OSM: wall, retaining_wall, fence, guard_rail, hedge ...), height (0 = untagged), wall / material, [x, z, ...]]: within 30 m","coast":"[x, z, ...]: the coastline within 400 m (OSM: the land on the left of the way's direction, the sea on the right)","cliffs":"[x, z, ...]: cliffs within 300 m (OSM: the lower side on the right)","lakes":"[water (OSM water=: lake, river, pond ...), name (geographic), closed (0: a ring cut off where the data ends), [x, z, ...]]: lakes and rivers as areas within 100 m","shore":"[natural (beach, bare_rock ...), [x, z, ...] outline]: within 300 m","water":"[waterway, name (geographic), culvert / tunnel, [x, z, ...]]: streams within 100 m","rail":"[railway (rail, funicular ...), bridge, tunnel, [x, z, ...]]: within 200 m","roads":"[highway, lanes, width, 1 bridge / 2 tunnel, layer, surface, name (geographic), par (1: a carriageway alongside the route), [x, z, ...]]: other roads and paths within 60 m (clipped to 80 m)","side":"[s, side (1 right, -1 left), angle (deg from the travel direction, + right), highway, lanes or width, oneway, name (geographic), [x, z, ...] the first 60 m from the junction]: every road and path that meets the route","onRoad":"[s, kind (crossing, traffic_signals, stop, give_way, calming), detail]","lamps":"[x, z]: street lamps within 30 m","stops":"[s, side, distance, shelter]: bus stops within 30 m","bridges":"[s0, s1]: the route on a bridge","over":"[s, rail / road, kind]: a railway or road on a bridge over the route","landmarks":"[label (game, Slovenian), English, kind, s, d, [x, z, ...] outline]: s and d of its nearest point","places":"[label, x, z, s, d of